title: AWS v2 ApplicationELB: Target Groups
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors target groups of AWS Application ELB and reports a
 summary across all target groups.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related special agent
 {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 The service goes

 - {CRIT} if at least on target group is unhealthy

 - {UNKNOWN} if the state is unknown

 - {OK} in all other cases

discovery:
 One service is created.
